          "id": "najashi-5",
          "type": "reflect",
          "ar": "وصفته أمُّ سلمة يوم نزلوا بأرضه بأنه [«خيرَ جار»](h:ahmad:1740)، ووصفه رسول الله ﷺ يوم مات بأنه [«رجلٌ صالح»](h:bukhari:3877)، وقال لأصحابه: [«فصلُّوا على أخيكم أصحمة»](h:bukhari:3877)؛ جمعهم الإيمان وإن تباعدت الديار.",
          "en": "Umm Salamah described him, when they settled in his land, as [\"the best of neighbours\"](h:ahmad:1740); the Messenger of Allah ﷺ described him, on the day he died, as [\"a righteous man\"](h:bukhari:3877), and told his Companions: [\"pray over your brother Ashamah\"](h:bukhari:3877). Faith had made them brothers, however far apart their lands."
